   repository does not grant any of these rights.

3. THE DEMONSTRATION

   Access to the running demonstration linked from this page is a limited,
   revocable permission to evaluate the system for non-commercial research or
   academic purposes. It is NOT a licence to the software.

   The following are prohibited without prior written permission of KISTI:

     (a) any commercial use of the system or of its outputs;
     (b) redistribution, resale, or sublicensing of the system, its outputs,
         or any part of either;
     (c) reverse engineering, decompilation, or disassembly;
     (d) extraction of model weights, source code, prompts, or configuration;
     (e) automated or bulk access, or access to accounts, data, or functions
         other than those assigned to the user.

   The demonstration is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind, and may
   be modified, suspended, or withdrawn at any time without notice.

